{"id":"75c22d8e0af45459","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-monadic-so-game.md","title":"着色游戏刻画存在一元二阶保真","display":"thm-monadic-so-game — 着色游戏刻画存在一元二阶保真","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-monadic-so-game","aliases":["29-thm-monadic-so-game"],"display":"thm-monadic-so-game — 着色游戏刻画存在一元二阶保真","depends_on":["[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]","[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 8.2 and proof, p.126, DjVu scan 141","source_basis":"原书陈述与证明已阅读；扫描页141图像独立核对单向保真；本条仅取有限结构特例"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-monadic-so-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-monadic-so-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-monadic-so-game — 着色游戏刻画存在一元二阶保真"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa169cf9db0afb60\" href=\"?note=fa169cf9db0afb60\" title=\"29-df-monadic-so-game\">29-df-monadic-so-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 8.2 and proof, p.126, DjVu scan 141"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述与证明已阅读；扫描页141图像独立核对单向保真；本条仅取有限结构特例"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，可含常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}\">\\(\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\ \\to\\ B\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\ \\to\\ B\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 8.2，印刷页126、扫描页141。原书允许无限结构；本库现有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}\\)</span> 与 EF 游戏均取有限非空结构，故这里是明确的有限特例。原书写矩阵秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，这里使用至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；在非空结构上可以加未使用的个体量词把较小秩补至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，不改变句子真值。</p>\n<p>已阅读原书双向证明并核对其在本接口下的对应。若 Delilah 获胜，从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中任一存在二阶句子的见证着色出发，她得到一个与之 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 轮 EF 等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 着色；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a> 保留矩阵真值。反向，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的任意着色，在有限关系词汇中选取该扩张结构的完整有界秩句子类型的有限合取，得到秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的特征句。单向保真给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中实现此特征句的着色，再由 FO 游戏定理得到回应策略。有界秩类型有限性可由有限原子式类型及逐秩量词类型递归得到；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span> 时可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,x=x\">\\(\\forall x\\,x=x\\)</span> 表示空合取。</p>\n<p>结论是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的单向保真，不是两结构对全部存在一元二阶句子的等价。交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 需要另一个着色游戏获胜条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-monadic-so-game","status":"resolved","id":"fa169cf9db0afb60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"已阅读原书双向证明并核对其在本接口下的对应。若 Delilah 获胜，从 $A$ 中任一存在二阶句子的见证着色出发，她得到一个与之 $m$ 轮 EF 等价的 $B$ 着色；[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]] 保留矩阵真值。反向，对 $A$ 的任意着色，在有限关系词汇中选取该扩张结构的完整有界秩句子类型的有限合取，得到秩至多 $m$ 的特征句。单向保真给出 $B$ 中实现此特征句的着色，再由 FO 游戏定理得到回应策略。有界秩类型有限性可由有限原子式类型及逐秩量词类型递归得到；$m\\geq1$ 时可用 $\\forall x\\,x=x$ 表示空合取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\ \\to\\ B\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\Phi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,x=x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":2222,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]、[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]、[[29-thm-monadic-so-game]] — 一元存在二阶片段及着色游戏的单向保真"},{"id":"93bcfaaefa338233","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"论证在 $I=\\varnothing$ 或 $I=K$ 时仍相容：这两个相对查询可由矛盾句或恒真句表达，游戏中则缺少一方所需的结构。所用有限类型原理与 [[29-thm-monadic-so-game]] 相同；没有把一般二阶类型误当作有限个。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-monadic-so-game]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-monadic-so-game|29-thm-monadic-so-game]]"}],"outgoing":["fa169cf9db0afb60","cf492b2a5223a49a","0539a14219495918"]}